## 7. 5 Coding Problems (Copy Assignment)

1. **Safe `DynamicName` Class:** Store `char* name_`, implement constructor, copy constructor, exception-safe `operator=`, and destructor. Test `n1 = n1;` and `n1 = n2 = n3;`.
   *Check:* Use `std::strlen` + `new char[len + 1]` before `delete[] name_`.
