    inline static int v = 10;
};
// int Bad::v = 10; // <-- What happens if this line is uncommented?
```
<details>
<summary>Reveal Answer</summary>

- **Result:** **COMPILE ERROR** (`redefinition of 'int Bad::v'`). `inline static int v = 10;` is *already* the definition!
</details>

